        "identifier": "https://github.com/sthubbar/goldbach-lean/tree/main/entries/hardylittlewood1923",
        "note": "The Hardy-Littlewood 1923 entry of this repository contains 88 of the 127 files used here, among them the unconditional circle method of LeanLab/PNTPort/Vinogradov and the ported files.",
        "relationship": "other"
      },
      {
        "identifier": "https://github.com/AlexKontorovich/PrimeNumberTheoremAnd",
        "note": "A search on 2026-10-25 of Mathlib v4.35.0-rc3, of PrimeNumberTheoremAnd at commit 127b50e33f6033e2147921167a117af96d9ba4ea, of google-deepmind/formal-conjectures at commit 37f0808b83c56c8cef4ea5816b8329c09b8905a8 and of the web found no earlier Lean formalization of any result of Alsetri and Shao 2024, and no Lean formalization of the transference principle for dense subsets of the primes.",
